User: I'm going through a legal process and need to organize my thoughts. The case involves custody dispute. My lawyer is Lisa Park with Park Legal Group; we have proceedings at family court in Austin. We have a deadline to submit documents in six weeks.. Opposing party: the other party in the dispute. This is in Multnomah County, Oregon. The contract was signed last year and they've since stopped pe...
